      "heading": null,
      "bodyHtml": "<p>Eco Driving is a Jaxicloud Fleet Management based app that helps assess a driver’s performance. The solution evaluates driving skills based on penalty points for such violations as speeding, unnecessary acceleration, heavy braking, cornering acceleration, etc.<br>Sensors installed in a vehicle detect violations. Driving behavior analysis helps to discipline and train drivers. Professional and careful driving, in turn, helps reduce fuel costs, extend vehicle life and improve fleet safety for passengers and cargo.</p><p><strong>Detailed description of violations</strong></p><p><strong>Active work towards each vehicle</strong></p>",
      "bodyText": "Eco Driving is a Jaxicloud Fleet Management based app that helps assess a driver’s performance. The solution evaluates driving skills based on penalty points for such violations as speeding, unnecessary acceleration, heavy braking, cornering acceleration, etc.Sensors installed in a vehicle detect violations. Driving behavior analysis helps to discipline and train drivers. Professional and careful driving, in turn, helps reduce fuel costs, extend vehicle life and improve fleet safety for passengers and cargo.Detailed description of violationsActive work towards each vehicle",
